**Rules Assessment:**
- Rule 1 (Tests Pass): 8/8 passing before and after
- Rule 2 (Reveals Intent): Improved — `candidates.filter(willBeAlive)` reads as a direct statement of the algorithm; the survival/birth logic is now a named domain concept
- Rule 3 (No Duplication): No changes; already DRY (shared `cellKey`, `neighborsOf`, unified predicate in filter)
- Rule 4 (Fewest Elements): One additional binding (`willBeAlive`); trade-off deliberately taken for clarity per Rule 2 > APP priority

